                                                                                
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*                                                                      *        
*  PROGRAM    :  W6154200                                              *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FUNKTION   :  "OVERVIEW OF OPEN DC LOCATIONS"                       *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FÖRFATTARE :  JOHAN LINDKVIST                                       *        
*                                                                      *        
*  NOTERING   :  ETT SKRÄCKEXEMPEL AV EPLUSPGM, BORDE ANVÄND ETT       *        
*                COBOL LISTPGM FÖR SISTA STEGET !!!          /JL       *        
*                                                                      *        
*  ÄNDRING    :                                                        *        
*                                                                      *        
*     DATUM       NAMN                     AVDELNING                   *        
*     ......      ..................       ......                      *        
*                                                                      *        
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W61542D1                                                                   
*                                                                               
%W01160    'IN-'                                                                
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W61542D2                                                                   
*                                                                               
%W48881  'BUF-'                                                                 
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W61542D3 FB(11 0)                                                          
*                                                                               
MERGE-IDDC           1    2 A                                                   
MERGE-ADLAGOMR       3    2 N                                                   
MERGE-ADGANG         5    2 N                                                   
MERGE-ADPLATS        7    5 N                                                   
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W61542D4                                                                   
*                                                                               
%W61540  'LOC-'                                                                 
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W61542D5 FB(52 0)                                                          
TMP-IDDC           1     2 A                                                    
TMP-ADLAGOMR       3     2 P 0                                                  
TMP-ADGANG         5     2 P 0                                                  
TMP-ADPLATS        7     3 P 0                                                  
TMP-KDLOC         10     1 A                                                    
TMP-KDSTOR        11     3 A                                                    
TMP-TESTORAGE     14    18 A                                                    
TMP-KDFREQ        32     2 A                                                    
TMP-KVPB-FOM      34     4 P 1                                                  
TMP-KVPB-TOM      38     4 P 1                                                  
TMP-TEFREQ        42    10 A                                                    
TMP-KDFLAGGA-FREE 52     1 A                                                    
*                                                                               
WS-KDSTOR-BEGIN   TMP-KDSTOR   1 A                                              
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W61542D6  PRINTER FB (124 0)                                               
*                                                                               
WS-TALLY-TOTAL W   4 P 0                                                        
WS-TALLY-FREE  W   4 P 0                                                        
                                                                                
WP-TALLY-TOTAL W   4 P 0                                                        
WP-TALLY-FREE  W   4 P 0                                                        
                                                                                
WR-TALLY-TOTAL W   4 P 0                                                        
WR-TALLY-FREE  W   4 P 0                                                        
*                                                                               
WS-PRI-BIN-TOT          W   4 P 0                                               
WS-PRI-BIN-FREE         W   4 P 0                                               
WS-PRI-RACK-TOT         W   4 P 0                                               
WS-PRI-RACK-FREE        W   4 P 0                                               
WS-PRI-FLOOR-TOT         W   4 P 0                                              
WS-PRI-FLOOR-FREE        W   4 P 0                                              
WS-PRI-DC-TOT           W   4 P 0                                               
WS-PRI-DC-FREE          W   4 P 0                                               
                                                                                
WS-RES-BIN-TOT          W   4 P 0                                               
WS-RES-BIN-FREE         W   4 P 0                                               
WS-RES-RACK-TOT         W   4 P 0                                               
WS-RES-RACK-FREE        W   4 P 0                                               
WS-RES-FLOOR-TOT         W   4 P 0                                              
WS-RES-FLOOR-FREE        W   4 P 0                                              
WS-RES-DC-TOT           W   4 P 0                                               
WS-RES-DC-FREE          W   4 P 0                                               
*                                                                               
WS-PERCENTAGE  W   3 N MASK 'ZZZ'                                               
*                                                                               
WS-PAGE        W   4 N MASK 'ZZZZ' VALUE 1                                      
WS-ROW         W   2 P 0 VALUE 1                                                
*                                                                               
WS-TOT-PRIME-TOTAL        W   4 P 0                                             
WS-TOT-PRIME-FREE         W   4 P 0                                             
WS-TOT-RESERVE-TOTAL      W   4 P 0                                             
WS-TOT-RESERVE-FREE       W   4 P 0                                             
*                                                                               
WS-KDSTOR      W   3 A                                                          
WS-TESTORAGE   W  18 A                                                          
WS-KDFREQ      W   2 A                                                          
WS-TEFREQ      W  10 A                                                          
WS-KVPB-FOM    W   4 P 1  MASK BWZ                                              
WS-KVPB-TOM    W   4 P 1  MASK BWZ                                              
WS-KDLOC       W   7 A                                                          
*                                                                               
SPAR-IDDC      W   2 A                                                          
SPAR-KDSTOR    W   3 A                                                          
SPAR-KDFREQ    W   2 A                                                          
SPAR-KDLOC     W   1 A                                                          
*                                                                               
FOERSTA        W   1 A VALUE 'J'                                                
*    -- CHECKED BY WY2000                                                       
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
* STEG 1. MERGE PART PRIME LOCATION WITH PART RESERVE LOCATION                  
*                                                                               
JOB INPUT NULL  +                                                               
          NAME (STEP1)                                                          
                                                                                
  GET W61542D1                                                                  
  DO WHILE NOT EOF W61542D1                                                     
     IF IN-CLAG-ADLAGOMR NE 0 AND IN-CLAG-ADPLATS NE 0                          
        MERGE-IDDC       = '11'                                                 
        MERGE-ADLAGOMR   = IN-CLAG-ADLAGOMR                                     
        MERGE-ADGANG     = IN-CLAG-ADGANG                                       
        MERGE-ADPLATS    = IN-CLAG-ADPLATS                                      
        PUT W61542D3                                                            
     END-IF                                                                     
     GET W61542D1                                                               
  END-DO                                                                        
                                                                                
  GET W61542D2                                                                  
  DO WHILE NOT EOF W61542D2                                                     
     IF BUF-ADBUFFOMR NE 0 AND BUF-ADBUFFPL NE 0                                
        MERGE-IDDC       = BUF-IDDC                                             
        MERGE-ADLAGOMR   = BUF-ADBUFFOMR                                        
        MERGE-ADGANG     = BUF-ADBUFFGANG                                       
        MERGE-ADPLATS    = BUF-ADBUFFPL                                         
        PUT W61542D3                                                            
     END-IF                                                                     
     GET W61542D2                                                               
  END-DO                                                                        
                                                                                
  STOP                                                                          
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
* STEG 2. SORT THE MERGE FILE ON LOCATION                                       
*                                                                               
SORT W61542D3 TO W61542D3 USING (MERGE-IDDC, MERGE-ADLAGOMR,  +                 
                                 MERGE-ADGANG, MERGE-ADPLATS) +                 
                                                   NAME (STEP2)                 
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
* STEG 3. ASSIGN CODE FREE/TAKEN LOCATION                                       
*                                                                               
JOB INPUT (W61542D4 KEY (LOC-IDDC, LOC-ADLAGOMR, LOC-ADGANG,       +            
                                                 LOC-ADPLATS)      +            
           W61542D3 KEY (MERGE-IDDC, MERGE-ADLAGOMR, MERGE-ADGANG, +            
                                                   MERGE-ADPLATS)) +            
                                                   NAME (STEP3)                 
  IF MATCHED                                                                    
     TMP-KDFLAGGA-FREE = 'N'                                                    
     PERFORM ASSIGN-VALUES-TO-FILE                                              
     PUT W61542D5                                                               
  ELSE                                                                          
     IF W61542D4                                                                
        TMP-KDFLAGGA-FREE = 'J'                                                 
        PERFORM ASSIGN-VALUES-TO-FILE                                           
        PUT W61542D5                                                            
     END-IF                                                                     
  END-IF                                                                        
                                                                                
ASSIGN-VALUES-TO-FILE. PROC                                                     
   TMP-IDDC           =   LOC-IDDC                                              
   TMP-ADLAGOMR       =   LOC-ADLAGOMR                                          
   TMP-ADGANG         =   LOC-ADGANG                                            
   TMP-ADPLATS        =   LOC-ADPLATS                                           
   TMP-KDLOC          =   LOC-KDLOC                                             
   TMP-KDSTOR         =   LOC-KDSTOR                                            
   TMP-TESTORAGE      =   LOC-TESTORAGE                                         
   TMP-KDFREQ         =   LOC-KDFREQ                                            
   TMP-KVPB-FOM       =   LOC-KVPB-FOM                                          
   TMP-KVPB-TOM       =   LOC-KVPB-TOM                                          
   TMP-TEFREQ         =   LOC-TEFREQ                                            
END-PROC                                                                        
*                                                                               
* STEG 4. SORT THE MERGE FILE ON KDSTOR, KDFREQ....                             
*                                                                               
SORT W61542D5 TO W61542D5 USING (TMP-IDDC, TMP-KDSTOR, TMP-KDFREQ, +            
                                                       TMP-KDLOC)  +            
                                                       NAME (STEP4)             
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
* STEG 5. LIST LOCATION                                                         
*                                                                               
JOB INPUT  W61542D5 +                                                           
    NAME (STEP5)    +                                                           
    FINISH (PRINT-DC-TOTALS)                                                    
                                                                                
  IF FOERSTA = 'J'                                                              
     PERFORM A-INIT                                                             
     MOVE 'N' TO FOERSTA                                                        
  END-IF                                                                        
                                                                                
  IF TMP-KDSTOR = SPAR-KDSTOR                                                   
     IF TMP-KDFREQ = SPAR-KDFREQ                                                
        PERFORM TALLY-POST                                                      
     ELSE                                                                       
        PERFORM PRINT-LOCATIONS                                                 
        PERFORM ASSIGN-NEW-INFO                                                 
        PERFORM CLEAR-KDSTOR-INFO                                               
        PERFORM CLEAR-TALLYS                                                    
        PERFORM TALLY-POST                                                      
     END-IF                                                                     
  ELSE                                                                          
     PERFORM PRINT-LOCATIONS                                                    
     PERFORM PRINT-TOTALS                                                       
     PERFORM ASSIGN-NEW-INFO                                                    
     PERFORM CLEAR-TALLYS                                                       
     PERFORM TALLY-POST                                                         
  END-IF                                                                        
                                                                                
  IF SPAR-IDDC NE TMP-IDDC                                                      
    PERFORM PRINT-DC-TOTALS                                                     
    IF WS-ROW > 1                                                               
       PERFORM NEWPAGE-LOOP                                                     
    END-IF                                                                      
    PERFORM ASSIGN-NEW-INFO                                                     
    WS-PAGE = 1                                                                 
    WS-ROW  = 1                                                                 
  END-IF                                                                        
                                                                                
  SPAR-IDDC   = TMP-IDDC                                                        
  SPAR-KDSTOR = TMP-KDSTOR                                                      
  SPAR-KDFREQ = TMP-KDFREQ                                                      
*                                                                               
* SUBRUTINER                                                                    
*                                                                               
A-INIT. PROC                                                                    
    SPAR-IDDC   = TMP-IDDC                                                      
    SPAR-KDSTOR = TMP-KDSTOR                                                    
    SPAR-KDFREQ = TMP-KDFREQ                                                    
                                                                                
    PERFORM CLEAR-TALLYS                                                        
    PERFORM ASSIGN-NEW-INFO                                                     
END-PROC                                                                        
                                                                                
MANUELL-SIDNUMRERING. PROC                                                      
   WS-ROW  = WS-ROW  + 1                                                        
   IF WS-ROW > 33                                                               
     WS-PAGE = WS-PAGE + 1                                                      
     WS-ROW = 1                                                                 
   END-IF                                                                       
END-PROC                                                                        
                                                                                
NEWPAGE-LOOP. PROC                                                              
   DO WHILE WS-ROW < 34                                                         
      PERFORM CLEAR-INFO                                                        
      PRINT RAPPORT01                                                           
      WS-ROW = WS-ROW + 1                                                       
   END-DO                                                                       
END-PROC                                                                        
                                                                                
TALLY-POST. PROC                                                                
    IF TMP-KDLOC         = 'P'                                                  
       WP-TALLY-TOTAL = WP-TALLY-TOTAL + 1                                      
       IF WS-KDSTOR-BEGIN = 'R'                                                 
          IF TMP-KDFLAGGA-FREE = 'J'                                            
             WP-TALLY-FREE = WP-TALLY-FREE + 1                                  
             WS-PRI-RACK-FREE = WS-PRI-RACK-FREE + 1                            
          END-IF                                                                
          WS-PRI-RACK-TOT = WS-PRI-RACK-TOT + 1                                 
       ELSE                                                                     
          IF WS-KDSTOR-BEGIN = 'B' 'D'                                          
             IF TMP-KDFLAGGA-FREE = 'J'                                         
                WP-TALLY-FREE = WP-TALLY-FREE + 1                               
                WS-PRI-BIN-FREE = WS-PRI-BIN-FREE + 1                           
             END-IF                                                             
             WS-PRI-BIN-TOT = WS-PRI-BIN-TOT + 1                                
          ELSE                                                                  
             IF TMP-KDFLAGGA-FREE = 'J'                                         
                WP-TALLY-FREE = WP-TALLY-FREE + 1                               
                WS-PRI-FLOOR-FREE = WS-PRI-FLOOR-FREE + 1                       
             END-IF                                                             
             WS-PRI-FLOOR-TOT = WS-PRI-FLOOR-TOT + 1                            
          END-IF                                                                
       END-IF                                                                   
    ELSE                                                                        
       WR-TALLY-TOTAL = WR-TALLY-TOTAL + 1                                      
       IF WS-KDSTOR-BEGIN = 'R'                                                 
          IF TMP-KDFLAGGA-FREE = 'J'                                            
             WR-TALLY-FREE = WR-TALLY-FREE + 1                                  
             WS-RES-RACK-FREE = WS-RES-RACK-FREE + 1                            
          END-IF                                                                
          WS-RES-RACK-TOT = WS-RES-RACK-TOT + 1                                 
       ELSE                                                                     
          IF WS-KDSTOR-BEGIN = 'B' 'D'                                          
             IF TMP-KDFLAGGA-FREE = 'J'                                         
                WR-TALLY-FREE = WR-TALLY-FREE + 1                               
                WS-RES-BIN-FREE = WS-RES-BIN-FREE + 1                           
             END-IF                                                             
             WS-RES-BIN-TOT = WS-RES-BIN-TOT + 1                                
          ELSE                                                                  
             IF TMP-KDFLAGGA-FREE = 'J'                                         
                WR-TALLY-FREE = WR-TALLY-FREE + 1                               
                WS-RES-FLOOR-FREE = WS-RES-FLOOR-FREE + 1                       
             END-IF                                                             
             WS-RES-FLOOR-TOT = WS-RES-FLOOR-TOT + 1                            
          END-IF                                                                
       END-IF                                                                   
    END-IF                                                                      
END-PROC                                                                        
                                                                                
CLEAR-INFO. PROC                                                                
    WS-KDSTOR       = '   '                                                     
    WS-TESTORAGE    = '                  '                                      
    WS-KDFREQ       = '  '                                                      
    WS-TEFREQ       = '          '                                              
    WS-KVPB-FOM     = 0                                                         
    WS-KVPB-TOM     = 0                                                         
    WS-KDLOC        = '       '                                                 
    WS-TALLY-TOTAL  = 0                                                         
    WS-TALLY-FREE   = 0                                                         
    WS-PERCENTAGE   = 0                                                         
END-PROC                                                                        
                                                                                
PRINT-LOCATIONS. PROC                                                           
    WS-KDLOC = 'PRIME  '                                                        
    WS-TALLY-TOTAL  = WP-TALLY-TOTAL                                            
    WS-TALLY-FREE   = WP-TALLY-FREE                                             
    IF WP-TALLY-FREE > 0                                                        
       WS-PERCENTAGE = (WP-TALLY-FREE / WP-TALLY-TOTAL) * 100                   
    ELSE                                                                        
       WS-PERCENTAGE = 0                                                        
    END-IF                                                                      
    PRINT RAPPORT01                                                             
    PERFORM MANUELL-SIDNUMRERING                                                
    PERFORM CLEAR-KDSTOR-INFO                                                   
    PERFORM SAVE-PRIME-LOCATIONS                                                
                                                                                
    PERFORM CLEAR-KDFREQ-INFO                                                   
    WS-KDLOC = 'RESERVE'                                                        
    WS-TALLY-TOTAL  = WR-TALLY-TOTAL                                            
    WS-TALLY-FREE   = WR-TALLY-FREE                                             
    IF WR-TALLY-FREE > 0                                                        
       WS-PERCENTAGE = (WR-TALLY-FREE / WR-TALLY-TOTAL) * 100                   
    ELSE                                                                        
       WS-PERCENTAGE = 0                                                        
    END-IF                                                                      
    IF WR-TALLY-TOTAL > 0                                                       
       PRINT RAPPORT01                                                          
       PERFORM MANUELL-SIDNUMRERING                                             
    END-IF                                                                      
    PERFORM SAVE-RESERVE-LOCATIONS                                              
                                                                                
END-PROC                                                                        
                                                                                
PRINT-TOTALS. PROC                                                              
    PERFORM CLEAR-KDSTOR-INFO                                                   
    PERFORM CLEAR-KDFREQ-INFO                                                   
                                                                                
    WS-KDLOC        = 'TOT (P)'                                                 
    WS-TALLY-TOTAL  = WS-TOT-PRIME-TOTAL                                        
    WS-TALLY-FREE   = WS-TOT-PRIME-FREE                                         
    IF WS-TOT-PRIME-FREE > 0                                                    
       WS-PERCENTAGE = (WS-TOT-PRIME-FREE / WS-TOT-PRIME-TOTAL) * 100           
    ELSE                                                                        
       WS-PERCENTAGE = 100                                                      
    END-IF                                                                      
    PRINT RAPPORT01                                                             
    PERFORM MANUELL-SIDNUMRERING                                                
    WS-TOT-PRIME-TOTAL   = 0                                                    
    WS-TOT-PRIME-FREE    = 0                                                    
                                                                                
    WS-KDLOC        = 'TOT (R)'                                                 
    WS-TALLY-TOTAL  = WS-TOT-RESERVE-TOTAL                                      
    WS-TALLY-FREE   = WS-TOT-RESERVE-FREE                                       
    IF WS-TOT-RESERVE-FREE > 0                                                  
    WS-PERCENTAGE = (WS-TOT-RESERVE-FREE / WS-TOT-RESERVE-TOTAL) * 100          
    ELSE                                                                        
       WS-PERCENTAGE = 100                                                      
    END-IF                                                                      
    IF WS-TOT-RESERVE-FREE > 0                                                  
       PRINT RAPPORT01                                                          
       PERFORM MANUELL-SIDNUMRERING                                             
    END-IF                                                                      
    WS-TOT-RESERVE-TOTAL = 0                                                    
    WS-TOT-RESERVE-FREE  = 0                                                    
                                                                                
    PERFORM PRINT-EMPTY-LINE                                                    
END-PROC                                                                        
                                                                                
PRINT-EMPTY-LINE. PROC                                                          
    WS-KDSTOR       = '---'                                                     
    WS-TESTORAGE    = '------------------'                                      
    WS-KDFREQ       = '--'                                                      
    WS-TEFREQ       = '----------'                                              
    WS-KVPB-FOM     = 0                                                         
    WS-KVPB-TOM     = 0                                                         
    WS-KDLOC        = '-------'                                                 
    WS-TALLY-TOTAL  = 0                                                         
    WS-TALLY-FREE   = 0                                                         
    WS-PERCENTAGE   = 0                                                         
                                                                                
    PRINT RAPPORT01                                                             
    PERFORM MANUELL-SIDNUMRERING                                                
END-PROC                                                                        
                                                                                
PRINT-DC-TOTALS. PROC                                                           
    PERFORM PRINT-EMPTY-LINE                                                    
                                                                                
    WS-TESTORAGE   = 'LOCATION SUMMARY '                                        
    WS-TEFREQ      = 'PRIME     '                                               
    WS-KDLOC       = 'BIN    '                                                  
    WS-TALLY-TOTAL  = WS-PRI-BIN-TOT                                            
    WS-TALLY-FREE  = WS-PRI-BIN-FREE                                            
    IF WS-TALLY-FREE > 0                                                        
       WS-PERCENTAGE = (WS-TALLY-FREE / WS-TALLY-TOTAL) * 100                   
    ELSE                                                                        
       WS-PERCENTAGE = 1                                                        
    END-IF                                                                      
    PRINT RAPPORT01                                                             
    PERFORM MANUELL-SIDNUMRERING                                                
                                                                                
    WS-TESTORAGE   = 'LOCATION SUMMARY '                                        
    WS-TEFREQ      = 'PRIME     '                                               
    WS-KDLOC       = 'RACK   '                                                  
    WS-TALLY-TOTAL  = WS-PRI-RACK-TOT                                           
    WS-TALLY-FREE  = WS-PRI-RACK-FREE                                           
    IF WS-TALLY-FREE > 0                                                        
       WS-PERCENTAGE = (WS-TALLY-FREE / WS-TALLY-TOTAL) * 100                   
    ELSE                                                                        
       WS-PERCENTAGE = 1                                                        
    END-IF                                                                      
    PRINT RAPPORT01                                                             
    PERFORM MANUELL-SIDNUMRERING                                                
                                                                                
    IF WS-PRI-FLOOR-TOT > 0                                                     
       WS-TESTORAGE = 'LOCATION SUMMARY '                                       
       WS-TEFREQ   = 'PRIME     '                                               
       WS-KDLOC    = 'FLOOR  '                                                  
       WS-TALLY-TOTAL = WS-PRI-FLOOR-TOT                                        
       WS-TALLY-FREE = WS-PRI-FLOOR-FREE                                        
       IF WS-TALLY-FREE > 0                                                     
          WS-PERCENTAGE = (WS-TALLY-FREE / WS-TALLY-TOTAL) * 100                
       ELSE                                                                     
          WS-PERCENTAGE = 1                                                     
       END-IF                                                                   
       PRINT RAPPORT01                                                          
       PERFORM MANUELL-SIDNUMRERING                                             
    END-IF                                                                      
                                                                                
    WS-TESTORAGE   = 'LOCATION SUMMARY '                                        
    WS-TEFREQ      = 'PRIME     '                                               
    WS-KDLOC       = 'DC TOT.'                                                  
    WS-TALLY-TOTAL = WS-PRI-RACK-TOT + WS-PRI-BIN-TOT    + +                    
                     WS-PRI-FLOOR-TOT                                           
    WS-TALLY-FREE  = WS-PRI-RACK-FREE + WS-PRI-BIN-FREE  + +                    
                     WS-PRI-FLOOR-FREE                                          
    IF WS-TALLY-FREE > 0                                                        
       WS-PERCENTAGE = (WS-TALLY-FREE / WS-TALLY-TOTAL) * 100                   
    ELSE                                                                        
       WS-PERCENTAGE = 1                                                        
    END-IF                                                                      
    PRINT RAPPORT01                                                             
    PERFORM MANUELL-SIDNUMRERING                                                
                                                                                
    IF WS-RES-BIN-TOT > 0                                                       
       WS-TESTORAGE = 'LOCATION SUMMARY '                                       
       WS-TEFREQ   = 'RESERVE   '                                               
       WS-KDLOC    = 'BIN    '                                                  
       WS-TALLY-TOTAL = WS-RES-BIN-TOT                                          
       WS-TALLY-FREE = WS-RES-BIN-FREE                                          
       IF WS-TALLY-FREE > 0                                                     
          WS-PERCENTAGE = (WS-TALLY-FREE / WS-TALLY-TOTAL) * 100                
       ELSE                                                                     
          WS-PERCENTAGE = 1                                                     
       END-IF                                                                   
       PRINT RAPPORT01                                                          
       PERFORM MANUELL-SIDNUMRERING                                             
    END-IF                                                                      
                                                                                
    IF WS-RES-RACK-TOT > 0                                                      
       WS-TESTORAGE = 'LOCATION SUMMARY '                                       
       WS-TEFREQ   = 'RESERVE   '                                               
       WS-KDLOC    = 'RACK   '                                                  
       WS-TALLY-TOTAL = WS-RES-RACK-TOT                                         
       WS-TALLY-FREE = WS-RES-RACK-FREE                                         
       IF WS-TALLY-FREE > 0                                                     
          WS-PERCENTAGE = (WS-TALLY-FREE / WS-TALLY-TOTAL) * 100                
       ELSE                                                                     
          WS-PERCENTAGE = 1                                                     
       END-IF                                                                   
       PRINT RAPPORT01                                                          
       PERFORM MANUELL-SIDNUMRERING                                             
    END-IF                                                                      
                                                                                
    IF WS-RES-FLOOR-TOT > 0                                                     
       WS-TESTORAGE = 'LOCATION SUMMARY '                                       
       WS-TEFREQ   = 'RESERVE   '                                               
       WS-KDLOC    = 'FLOOR  '                                                  
       WS-TALLY-TOTAL = WS-RES-FLOOR-TOT                                        
       WS-TALLY-FREE = WS-RES-FLOOR-FREE                                        
       IF WS-TALLY-FREE > 0                                                     
          WS-PERCENTAGE = (WS-TALLY-FREE / WS-TALLY-TOTAL) * 100                
       ELSE                                                                     
          WS-PERCENTAGE = 1                                                     
       END-IF                                                                   
       PRINT RAPPORT01                                                          
       PERFORM MANUELL-SIDNUMRERING                                             
    END-IF                                                                      
                                                                                
    WS-TALLY-TOTAL = WS-RES-RACK-TOT + WS-RES-BIN-TOT     + +                   
                     WS-RES-FLOOR-TOT                                           
    IF WS-TALLY-TOTAL > 0                                                       
       WS-TESTORAGE = 'LOCATION SUMMARY '                                       
       WS-TEFREQ   = 'RESERVE   '                                               
       WS-KDLOC    = 'DC TOT.'                                                  
       WS-TALLY-FREE = WS-RES-RACK-FREE + WS-RES-BIN-FREE + +                   
                       WS-RES-FLOOR-FREE                                        
       IF WS-TALLY-FREE > 0                                                     
          WS-PERCENTAGE = (WS-TALLY-FREE / WS-TALLY-TOTAL) * 100                
       ELSE                                                                     
          WS-PERCENTAGE = 1                                                     
       END-IF                                                                   
       PRINT RAPPORT01                                                          
       PERFORM MANUELL-SIDNUMRERING                                             
    END-IF                                                                      
*                                                                               
* CLEAR SUMMARIES                                                               
                                                                                
WS-PRI-BIN-TOT     = 0                                                          
WS-PRI-BIN-FREE    = 0                                                          
WS-PRI-RACK-TOT    = 0                                                          
WS-PRI-RACK-FREE   = 0                                                          
WS-PRI-FLOOR-TOT   = 0                                                          
WS-PRI-FLOOR-FREE  = 0                                                          
WS-PRI-DC-TOT      = 0                                                          
WS-PRI-DC-FREE     = 0                                                          
                                                                                
WS-RES-BIN-TOT     = 0                                                          
WS-RES-BIN-FREE    = 0                                                          
WS-RES-RACK-TOT    = 0                                                          
WS-RES-RACK-FREE   = 0                                                          
WS-RES-FLOOR-TOT   = 0                                                          
WS-RES-FLOOR-FREE  = 0                                                          
WS-RES-DC-TOT      = 0                                                          
WS-RES-DC-FREE     = 0                                                          
END-PROC                                                                        
                                                                                
SAVE-PRIME-LOCATIONS. PROC                                                      
    WS-TOT-PRIME-TOTAL   = WS-TOT-PRIME-TOTAL   + WP-TALLY-TOTAL                
    WS-TOT-PRIME-FREE    = WS-TOT-PRIME-FREE    + WP-TALLY-FREE                 
END-PROC                                                                        
                                                                                
SAVE-RESERVE-LOCATIONS. PROC                                                    
    WS-TOT-RESERVE-TOTAL = WS-TOT-RESERVE-TOTAL + WR-TALLY-TOTAL                
    WS-TOT-RESERVE-FREE  = WS-TOT-RESERVE-FREE  + WR-TALLY-FREE                 
END-PROC                                                                        
                                                                                
CLEAR-TALLYS. PROC                                                              
    WS-TALLY-TOTAL = 0                                                          
    WS-TALLY-FREE  = 0                                                          
    WP-TALLY-TOTAL = 0                                                          
    WP-TALLY-FREE  = 0                                                          
    WR-TALLY-TOTAL = 0                                                          
    WR-TALLY-FREE  = 0                                                          
END-PROC                                                                        
                                                                                
CLEAR-KDSTOR-INFO. PROC                                                         
    WS-KDSTOR     = ' '                                                         
    WS-TESTORAGE  = ' '                                                         
END-PROC                                                                        
                                                                                
CLEAR-KDFREQ-INFO. PROC                                                         
    WS-KDFREQ     = ' '                                                         
    WS-TEFREQ     = ' '                                                         
    WS-KVPB-FOM   = 0                                                           
    WS-KVPB-TOM   = 0                                                           
END-PROC                                                                        
                                                                                
ASSIGN-NEW-INFO. PROC                                                           
    WS-KDSTOR     =  TMP-KDSTOR                                                 
    WS-TESTORAGE  =  TMP-TESTORAGE                                              
                                                                                
    WS-KDFREQ     =  TMP-KDFREQ                                                 
    WS-TEFREQ     =  TMP-TEFREQ                                                 
    WS-KVPB-FOM   =  TMP-KVPB-FOM                                               
    WS-KVPB-TOM   =  TMP-KVPB-TOM                                               
END-PROC                                                                        
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
REPORT RAPPORT01 PRINTER W61542D6 LINESIZE 123 NOPAGE                           
                                                                                
TITLE 1  'VOLVO CAR PARTS       W61542-001     ' +                              
         '                                       PAGE: ' WS-PAGE                
TITLE 2  'OVERVIEW OF OPEN DC LOCATIONS IN DC: ' SPAR-IDDC                      
                                                                                
HEADING   WS-KDSTOR           ('STORAGE' 'CODE')                                
HEADING   WS-TESTORAGE        ('STORAGE' 'DESCR.')                              
HEADING   WS-KDFREQ           ('FREQ.' 'CODE')                                  
HEADING   WS-TEFREQ           ('FREQUENCY' 'DESCR.')                            
HEADING   WS-KVPB-FOM         ('FORE' 'CAST' 'FROM')                            
HEADING   WS-KVPB-TOM         ('FORE' 'CAST' ' TO ')                            
HEADING   WS-KDLOC            ('TYPE' 'LOC.')                                   
HEADING   WS-TALLY-TOTAL      ('ALL' 'LOC')                                     
HEADING   WS-TALLY-FREE       ('OPEN' 'LOC.')                                   
HEADING   WS-PERCENTAGE       ('PER-' 'CENT')                                   
LINE  1   WS-KDSTOR      +                                                      
          WS-TESTORAGE   +                                                      
          WS-KDFREQ      +                                                      
          WS-TEFREQ      +                                                      
